"The SkySea Guard patrols the sea and sky around Anesidora against escapes."
"Returned escapees face restrictions; emergency teleport is a fallback for those in trouble at sea."
"It buys information on runaways from the Informant, who supplies it with infogear."
"It wants runaways found before less tolerant parties beyond Anesidora's waters do."
"Near Matadero the System warns boats off a blockade, and closer in they hit shielding."
